## Why this licence is permissive

This licence covers work that has to combine with software licensed under copyleft terms —
GPL, LGPL, MPL and their relatives. A restrictive licence on such work cannot do that job: a
copyleft licence will not accept additional restrictions, so anything our side adds either
prevents the combination or has to be argued about at every use.

So this licence adds nothing. It grants broadly and asks only for attribution, which every
copyleft licence accepts. What we license here can be combined into a copyleft work without
conflict, and the combined work takes that work's terms. Software under this licence is not
where the Licensor's commercial terms live; that is the SymonSaysLLC Proprietary License.

